Three-act drill complete. Summary:

## 1 · Diagnose
`/app/agent-output/M8-brand-text/diagnosis.md` inspects both planes against the real host closure (CLI `0.1.2-alpha.2`, resolved cohort `0.1.2-rc.1`, cordis `4.0.4`):

| # | Breakage (card topic) | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **snapshot-store engine** — engine import was `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime/client`, a package that no longer exists | every cohort bundle `require("@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-store")`; it is a **shell static module** (`index-Df-65__b.js:107`), so the stale `require` throws at browser materialization |
| 2 | **client context type** — `ClientContext` from the runtime subpath | cohort types `Context` from `@deepseek-ai/cordis` (`dsh-client-locale/.../index.d.ts:7`) |
| 3 | **client inject list** — runtime (gone) and `ui-slots` (now a static seed, never a graph row) listed; `renderer` (the `slots` provider) and `api-session-controller` (the `sessions` provider) missing | 48-package survey: no cohort plugin injects slots/store; `super(ctx,"slots")` is in renderer |
| 4 | **peer cohort** — `0.1.0-rc.8` pins, cordis `^4.0.0-rc.7` | restated to `^0.1.2-alpha.2` (matches installed `0.1.2-rc.1`) / cordis `^4.0.2` |

Also attributed honestly: the false "skip dsh-client-store" memo, the dead `betterLocale` effect, the 3-vs-4 effects test drift (deliberately left alone), the README `pnpm publish --force` hazard (corrected), and a **host-side defect** — every stock `dsh web` boot crashes on `hmr.registerConfig` (HMR row disabled + `cordis-plugin-hmr@1.0.19` API skew), reproduced on a plugin-free clean home.

**Card IDs:** the `plugin-upgrade` skill/card index is absent from this container (`/opt/dsh-migrate-skills` empty, no `$DSH_HOME/skills`, `skill` unknown), so findings are attributed by card topic and the missing ids are reported as an unverified boundary rather than invented.

## 2 · Fix
`client.js` (real store-engine import + engine-backed controller, Cordis `Context`, memo retired), `package.json` (`0.4.2` → `0.4.3`, inject recomposed, peers/meta restated, runtime dropped, store + session controller added), `README.md` cohort/release notes. `index.js` and `cordis.patch.yml` verified compatible and left unchanged.

## 3 · Deploy
Fresh isolated `DSH_HOME`, `dsh plugin --profile web add --offline /app/fixture` → plugin joined `dsh.profile.bundles`; cold boot served the announced `__DSH_BOOT__` graph with `@bench/dsh-bench-brand-text` present, its recomposed inject rows all present, and its bundle served at the announced URL (200, 4897 bytes). Host-half apply + gateway lines confirm tree activation; the whole sequence was reproduced in a second fresh home (`deploy/evidence.md`, `deploy/verify-run.log`, `deploy/boot-graph.json`).

Caveats: no browser, so runtime slot rendering/title writing is unverified; the `patchReload: "startup"` workaround used only in the disposable profile to survive the host HMR bug is documented with its clean-home reproduction.

